WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:26.518
Jeremy jumped between Ribby and the rat.

2
00:00:26.519 --> 00:00:32.257
"Go, Ribby!" he cried. "Hop away!"

3
00:00:32.258 --> 00:00:34.930
But Ribby stood still.

4
00:00:34.931 --> 00:00:38.554
"Hello, Mr. Dribber," she said calmly.

5
00:00:38.555 --> 00:00:41.355
"Have you met Jeremy?"

6
00:00:41.356 --> 00:00:44.341
Jeremy gasped.

7
00:00:44.342 --> 00:00:49.458
"Mr. Dribber is my friend," Ribby said.

8
00:00:49.459 --> 00:00:52.591
"And he's our neighbor."

9
00:00:52.592 --> 00:00:55.975
"Your friend?" Jeremy said.

10
00:00:55.976 --> 00:01:00.141
"But . . . Water rats are dangerous."

11
00:01:00.142 --> 00:01:02.819
Mr. Dribber frowned.

12
00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:06.255
"I am not dangerous," he said.

13
00:01:06.256 --> 00:01:10.348
"I only eat plants and bugs.

14
00:01:10.349 --> 00:01:13.690
I never hurt anyone!"

15
00:01:13.691 --> 00:01:18.127
The water rat disappeared in the tall grass.

16
00:01:18.128 --> 00:01:20.095
Ribby frowned.

17
00:01:20.096 --> 00:01:23.709
"Mr. Dribber is very kind, Jeremy!

18
00:01:23.710 --> 00:01:28.139
Why were you rude to him?"

19
00:01:28.140 --> 00:01:31.864
"I . . . I'm sorry," Jeremy said.

20
00:01:31.865 --> 00:01:34.553
"I was just surprised."

21
00:01:34.554 --> 00:01:37.479
Ribby didn't say anything.

22
00:01:37.480 --> 00:01:42.413
She stared down at the ground.

23
00:01:42.414 --> 00:01:46.372
"Um, Ribby," Jeremy asked.

24
00:01:46.373 --> 00:01:51.260
"Would you like to ride in my boat?"

25
00:01:51.261 --> 00:01:53.884
"No, thank you," Ribby said.

26
00:01:53.885 --> 00:01:55.853
"I do not like boats.

27
00:01:55.854 --> 00:01:57.897
They are not safe."

28
00:01:57.898 --> 00:02:01.921
"I will keep you safe," Jeremy said.

29
00:02:01.922 --> 00:02:03.911
Ribby shook her head.

30
00:02:03.912 --> 00:02:05.913
"No, thank you.

31
00:02:05.914 --> 00:02:15.711
Good-bye, Jeremy."
